    treated as a Fusion Summon.) You can banish this card from your GY, then target
    1 "Sinful Spoils" Spell/Trap in your GY; Set it, but it cannot be activated this
    turn. You can only use 1 "Azamina Determination" effect per turn, and only once
    that turn.
